Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.67,0:00:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我  我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.26,0:00:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你  白河同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.97,0:00:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  露娜要做的话我也要做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,妮可你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打工  这次PASS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊…那…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.15,0:00:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那  那我也愿意做…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.87,0:00:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还差一个人  还有人自愿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.79,0:00:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好  这时候就…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我推荐伊地知同学
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…伊地知同学?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.81,0:00:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我…我也愿意…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.77,0:01:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢我吧  朋友
Comment: 0,0:01:03.81,0:01:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:05.07,0:01:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:21.25,0:01:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,咦? 总觉得我好奇怪
Comment: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没有过 这样的感觉
Comment: 0,0:01:27.21,0:01:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,每当感受到你的温柔 为什么呢?
Comment: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的胸口就会感到难受
Comment: 0,0:01:34.39,0:01:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,相互交叠
Comment: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐混合
Comment: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,已经无论如何都无法停止了(无法!)
Comment: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,被烟火的光线给照亮的
Comment: 0,0:01:43.65,0:01:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你的侧脸
Comment: 0,0:01:48.65,0:01:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,人家正盯着你呢
Comment: 0,0:01:54.91,0:01:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌暧昧 待在我身边
Comment: 0,0:01:57.91,0:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,(一直一直 待在我身边)
Comment: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,LaLaLa
Comment: 0,0:02:01.00,0:02:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Love You
Comment: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
Comment: 0,0:02:04.08,0:02:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是恋爱吧
Comment: 0,0:02:06.58,0:02:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让我了解这感觉的
Comment: 0,0:02:09.59,0:02:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,(这是你带给我的感觉)
Comment: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对象是我真的可以吗?
Comment: 0,0:02:14.01,0:02:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,(对象是我真的可以吗?)
Comment: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知所措又无法更进一步 真是的…
Comment: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,忐忑不安又闪闪发光的现在
Comment: 0,0:02:21.27,0:02:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,逐渐染上可爱色彩的世界
Comment: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Love You Tender!
